export const ACTIONS={forward:'Walk forward',backward:'Walk backward',left:'Strafe left',right:'Strafe right',sprint:'Run',work:'Use tool',interact:'Visit shop',water:'Mark water',tools:'Mark tool shop',skills:'Mark skill lab',automation:'Mark automation'};
export const DEFAULT_BINDINGS={forward:'KeyW',backward:'KeyS',left:'KeyA',right:'KeyD',sprint:'ShiftLeft',work:'Space',interact:'KeyE',water:'Digit1',tools:'Digit2',skills:'Digit3',automation:'Digit4'};
export function defaultSettings(){return {bindings:{...DEFAULT_BINDINGS},sensitivity:1,invertY:false,fov:70,quality:'balanced',maxFPS:60,adaptiveResolution:true,showFPS:false};}
export function validKey(code){return typeof code==='string'&&/^(Key[A-Z]|Digit[0-9]|Arrow(Up|Down|Left|Right)|Shift(Left|Right)|Space|Enter|Backspace|Tab|BracketLeft|BracketRight|Comma|Period|Slash|Semicolon|Quote|Minus|Equal)$/.test(code);}
export function keyLabel(code){return ({Space:'Space',ShiftLeft:'Left Shift',ShiftRight:'Right Shift',ArrowUp:'↑',ArrowDown:'↓',ArrowLeft:'←',ArrowRight:'→'})[code]||code.replace(/^Key|^Digit/,'');}
export function bindKey(settings,action,code){if(!ACTIONS[action]||!validKey(code))return false;const old=settings.bindings[action];for(const other of Object.keys(ACTIONS))if(other!==action&&settings.bindings[other]===code)settings.bindings[other]=old;settings.bindings[action]=code;return true;}
export function loadSettings(raw){const d=defaultSettings();try{const s=JSON.parse(raw);if(!s)return d;if(s.bindings&&Object.keys(ACTIONS).every(k=>validKey(s.bindings[k]))&&new Set(Object.values(s.bindings)).size===Object.keys(ACTIONS).length)d.bindings={...s.bindings};if(Number.isFinite(s.sensitivity))d.sensitivity=Math.max(.2,Math.min(3,s.sensitivity));if(Number.isFinite(s.fov))d.fov=Math.max(50,Math.min(100,s.fov));if(['low','balanced','high'].includes(s.quality))d.quality=s.quality;if([0,30,60,90,120,144].includes(s.maxFPS))d.maxFPS=s.maxFPS;d.invertY=s.invertY===true;d.adaptiveResolution=s.adaptiveResolution!==false;d.showFPS=s.showFPS===true;}catch{}return d;}
